# Assessment brief is local project context only - never committed.
docs/assessment/

# Internal lead-review scratch. Never committed.
outputs/_leadreview/

# Solar-detector evaluation (docs/solar_evaluation.md). The imagery is working material and is
# not committed: crops, contact sheets and review sheets are ~130 MB and reproducible from
# data/eval_cache/. The labels, the frozen pre-registration, the build and scoring scripts and
# the result files ARE the evidence and are committed by the explicit un-ignores below.
outputs/_solar_eval/*
outputs/_solar_eval/crops/
outputs/_solar_eval/review/
!outputs/_solar_eval/labels.csv
!outputs/_solar_eval/labels_numbers_export.csv
